knr-ops-kit contains no source code copied from knr-ops. Its documentation
describes the knr-ops repository layout, its lifecycle steps, its golden rules
and its "add a workload cluster" procedure, and it quotes short passages from
the knr-ops README, AGENTS.md and docs/extending.md. The pattern itself, the
layout conventions and those procedures are the work of the knr-ops
contributors.

